FAN-01 low-pressure axial fan benchmark (manifest id w34d-fan01-fau-eaa-axial-fan)
  Files: validation-data/reference/w34d_fan01_characteristic_n1ug.csv, validation-data/reference/w34d_fan01_cad_sections.csv
  Source: Kroemer, Junger, Becker, Kaltenbacher, Czwielong, Schoder, 'FAN 01 Benchmark: Low Pressure Axial Fan in a Short Duct', Zenodo, doi:10.5281/zenodo.20037409 (v5, 2026); fan and rig: Zenger, Junger, Kaltenbacher, Becker, SAE Technical Paper 2016-01-1805 (2016)
  Attribution: FAN-01 benchmark, Friedrich-Alexander-Universitaet Erlangen-Nuernberg / EAA; cite Zenger et al., SAE 2016-01-1805
  Record: https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.20037409
  Licence: CC BY 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
